{"baseRefName":"main","baseRefOid":"c6975ca76f9f667f1250ba403d0e6da2aafe14d0","body":"The unrestricted complete-local-Noetherian-ring question is already answered negatively by examples credited to Ofer Gabber. The original OWR 2/2007 contribution states this immediately after posing the question; the dataset omitted that decisive passage. Van den Dries’s 2008 published abstract corroborates the answer ([DOI 10.1090/S0002-9939-08-09401-X](https://doi.org/10.1090/S0002-9939-08-09401-X)).\n\nThis source correction distinguishes levelwise quotient isomorphisms from compatible ones, finite-length quotients from finite sets, the positive algebraic-residue-field result, and the separate integral-domain restriction. It claims neither a new discovery nor a present-day resolution of that restricted domain question.\n\nValidation: a separate adversarial source review passed the exact question, attribution, original page, published abstract, source hash and elementary inverse-limit observation. The full original contribution was inspected. The 2008 full article was not retrieved, and Gabber’s construction was not independently reconstructed or proof-audited. These limitations remain explicit.\n\nDisposition: already_solved for the original unrestricted question, zero new substantive attempts. Only this problem’s attempt folder is changed.\n","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-09-30T06:27:13Z","authors":[{"email":"me@aleckriebel.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMDkzNzA=","login":"AlecKriebel","name":"Alec Kriebel"}],"committedDate":"2026-09-30T06:27:13Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Correct local ring reconstruction status to prior Gabber counterexamples","oid":"db54d44c5e44cc93c9f4dd29af7b6484dd505e95"},{"authoredDate":"2026-09-30T06:44:32Z","authors":[{"email":"me@aleckriebel.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMDkzNzA=","login":"AlecKriebel","name":"Alec Kriebel"}],"committedDate":"2026-09-30T06:44:32Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Add independent review of prior local-ring counterexample attribution","oid":"90249af1342e0b01983630a3c1a15317117cce7c"},{"authoredDate":"2026-09-30T06:48:24Z","authors":[{"email":"me@aleckriebel.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMDkzNzA=","login":"AlecKriebel","name":"Alec Kriebel"}],"committedDate":"2026-09-30T06:48:24Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Update queue status for 30000671 with reviewed PR outcome","oid":"d49a1bd56d8cc268159331e5ce868e258a32bb58"}],"files":[{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/QUEUE.md","additions":1,"deletions":1},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/30000671/README.md","additions":9,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/30000671/RESEARCH_LOG.md","additions":17,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/30000671/SOURCE_AUDIT.md","additions":37,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/30000671/SOURCE_STATUS.md","additions":48,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/30000671/readiness.json","additions":35,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/30000671/review/REVIEW.md","additions":66,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/30000671/review/review_summary.json","additions":29,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/30000671/review/source_verification.json","additions":45,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/30000671/source_checksums.json","additions":11,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/30000671/source_record.json","additions":70,"deletions":0},{"path":"unsolved_math_prioritization/attempts/30000671/turns.jsonl","additions":0,"deletions":0}],"headRefName":"dot/math-30000671","headRefOid":"d49a1bd56d8cc268159331e5ce868e258a32bb58","isDraft":true,"number":53,"state":"OPEN","title":"Correct local ring reconstruction status to prior Gabber counterexamples","url":"https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/pull/53"}
